{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/1.png?t=1750602615\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command a young witch who summons eight mystical guardians to forge an ultimate magic squad! Feel the exhilaration of overwhelming monstrous hordes with tactical swarm strategies! Melee protectors shield you in close combat while ranged allies flood the battlefield with dazzling barrages. Witness eight layers of attack effects converging in explosive synergy, instantly setting the entire battlefield ablaze with magical fury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u5907\u9009\u56fe2.gif?t=1750602615\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/2.png?t=1750602615\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Guardian's power is determined by their equipped position! Dual skills toggle based on gear placement! Seamlessly shift combat styles - execute precision sniping or unleash area-clearing devastation, mastering two tactical dimensions in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u5907\u9009\u56fe1.gif?t=1750602615\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/\u6218\u6597\u52a8\u56fe3.gif?t=1750602615\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/3.png?t=1750602615\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ascend duplicate guardians through stellar upgrades or forge celestial evolutions: Mystic Formula: Combine ? Cuddle Bunnies + ? = Lunar Deity Hare summoning colossal moons! With 300+ evolutionary branches, craft your mythic legion and unleash divine power beyond imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/\u5408\u6210.gif?t=1750602615\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/4.png?t=1750602615\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every match brings fresh mystic eggs stocked in the shop! Invest gold to hatch them, with chances to unleash high-tier celestial guardians! Complete the Codex to unlock 150+ wondrous protectors brimming with arcane power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/\u5b75\u86cb.gif?t=1750602615\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/title5.png?t=1750602615\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock over a dozen quirky random events\u2014scratch-offs, rhythm minigames! Trigger Lucky Crits for doubled rewards! Craft strategies to unleash infinite possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/\u522e\u522e\u4e50.gif?t=1750602615\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/\u97f3\u6e38.gif?t=1750602615\" /></div></p>","backgr